<section class="section dark"><div class="split"><h2>A signal gets noticed.<br>The team gets involved.</h2><p>Automation raises the signal. Engineers assess impact, investigate and bring in the right colleague.</p></div><article><p class="eyebrow">Illustrative scenario · storage warning</p><h3>Monitor → assess → investigate → involve → follow through.</h3><p>A warning is not yet a diagnosis. Context and business impact come first. The team investigates, acts and records follow-up.</p><small>Explanatory example. No measured timings.</small></article></section>